      }
    ]
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s3.w14.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "main.s3.w14.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s3.w14.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "clearSprites"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s3.w14.node.direction.mimi.opening",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s3.w14.asset.sprite.mimi.serious",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w14.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w14.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "路地の奥の湯は、石鹸と薪の匂い。番台のおじいさんが、先週と同じ顔で笑った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w14.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w14.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「おや。今度は、覚えのある顔だ」って、笑われた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w14.node.line.001c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w14.line.001c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……「三年ぶりだね」の答え合わせに、今日は来たんです。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w14.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w14.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "今日の用は、二つ。名簿の二人目をお願いすること。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w14.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w14.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "それから、三年ぶりの意味を聞くこと。私がこの湯に来たのは、先週が初めてのはずなのに。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w14.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w14.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "おじいさんが番台の下から、古い帳面を出した。湯の貸し借りの帳面らしい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w14.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w14.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "三年前の日付を、とん、と指す。「タオル一本、貸し。未返却」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w14.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w14.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "借り主の欄に——耳が、先に冷えた。私の名前だった。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s3.w14.node.direction.mimi.shift.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s3.w14.asset.sprite.mimi.confused",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w14.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w14.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "覚えて、いない。「雨の晩でな、空から落ってきた子を、担ぎ込んだんだ」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w14.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w14.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「冷えきっとったから、湯で温めて、タオルを貸して帰した」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w14.node.line.004c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w14.line.004c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……この世界で最初に触れたのは、登録の紙じゃなく、この湯だったんだ。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w14.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w14.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「それきり、来んかったがな」おじいさんは笑って、湯呑みを差し出した。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w14.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w14.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「なに、三年で返しに来りゃあ上等の口よ」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w14.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w14.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「世の中にゃ、四百年借りっぱなしの御仁もおるでな」……四百年?",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w14.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w14.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "湯に浸かって、分かったことがある。私の三年は、数えごとの紙で始まったんじゃない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w14.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w14.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "担いでくれた誰かと、貸しタオル一本で始まったんだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w14.node.line.006c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w14.line.006c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "持ち物の帳面より、貸し借りの帳面のほうが、先だった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w14.node.line.006d",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w14.line.006d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……なら、私の言い分は、湯の側にある。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s3.w14.node.direction.mimi.shift.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s3.w14.asset.sprite.mimi.smile",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w14.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w14.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "番台で、名簿を開いた。おじいさんは眼鏡をかけ、丁寧な字で名を書いた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w14.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w14.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "二人目だ。「常連にも、来た口が何人かおる。回しといてやろう」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w14.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w14.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……湯の世界にも、回状という文化があるらしい。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w14.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w14.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "帰りぎわ、三年越しのタオルを返した。洗って、糊もきかせて。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w14.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w14.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "おじいさんは検分して、帳面の行に、ゆっくり線を引いた。「完済」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w14.node.line.008c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w14.line.008c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……妙に、背筋まで伸びる、良い儀式だった。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w14.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w14.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "路地を出ると、仲間が名簿を覗いた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w14.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w14.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「二人。あと、九十八ですね」この先も、道は長い。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w14.node.line.009c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w14.line.009c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "長いが、湯はあと九つ。次は、山の湯だそうです。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "main.s3.w14.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "sharedPoints",
          "amount": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s3.w14.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
  "debug": {
